  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the implementation of the Africa CDC to strengthen health emergency preparedness and response in the Africa Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa CDC is a strategic partner of FCDO and a key public health organisation in Africa. FCDO technical assistance  will support Africa CDC&#x2019;s strategic priorities, namely through the implementation of the JEAP, including  strengthening of local manufacturing capacity,  Emergency Preparedness and Response (EPR) and Surveillance.  Support will be provided to specific Divisions of Africa CDC as well as to agreed activities within the Joint Emergency Action Plan (JEAP)</narrative>
  </description>
